{"title": "CR18 Lemma 4.5 — Composition of reductions",
 "body":
 {"xs":
  [{"xs":
    [{"xs":
      [{"s":
        "Let p, q and r be problems. Let ρ and ρ' be solver-transformations. Let τ and τ' be ≤-respecting functions. Then ",
        "kind": "text"},
       {"prov": null,
        "latex":
        "\\tau p \\le q \\rho \\,\\wedge\\, \\tau' q \\le r \\rho' \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\tau' \\tau p \\le r \\rho' \\rho",
        "kind": "math"},
       {"s": ".", "kind": "text"}],
      "kind": "concat"}],
    "kind": "paragraph"},
   {"xs":
